synthetic_gemini1_82,synthetic_gemini1,"Create a Passenger class with private Passenger ID, Airline Name, and Baggage Weight, initialized via parameterized constructor. Free Baggage Allowance is a static variable, initially 20 kg using a static block. If weight exceeds allowance, Excess Charge = (Weight - Allowance) x ₹500; otherwise ₹0. Implement static setFreeAllowance() to modify the allowance. Read 2 passengers, display each passenger's ID, airline, and initial excess charge; find the ID of the highest-paying passenger; then set allowance to 30 kg, recalculate both charges, and output their sum.","[{""role"": ""user"", ""content"": ""How do I write the Passenger class fields and the static free baggage allowance variable?""}, {""role"": ""assistant"", ""content"": ""You can declare private instance variables for ID, airline name, and baggage weight, and a static variable `freeAllowance` initialized via a static block set to 20. Here is how you can set that up:

```java
class Passenger {
    private String passengerId;
    private String airlineName;
    private double baggageWeight;
    private static double freeAllowance;

    static {
        freeAllowance = 20.0;
    }
```""}, {""role"": ""user"", ""content"": ""That makes sense. Now how do I write the parameterized constructor and the excess charge calculation method?""}, {""role"": ""assistant"", ""content"": ""You can add a constructor that takes the three values and assigns them to `this.passengerId`, `this.airlineName`, and `this.baggageWeight`. For the charge, you can check if weight exceeds `freeAllowance` and calculate `(weight - freeAllowance) * 500`. Here is that part:

```java
    public Passenger(String id, String airline, double weight) {
        this.passengerId = id;
        this.airlineName = airline;
        this.baggageWeight = weight;
    }

    public double calculateExcessCharge() {
        if (baggageWeight > freeAllowance) {
            return (baggageWeight - freeAllowance) * 500;
        }
        return 0.0;
    }
```""}]","I have those parts. Finally, how do I write the static setFreeAllowance method and the main method to read two passengers, find the highest-paying one, update allowance to 30, and output the sum of charges?","```java

